ut a home, without a culture, and without a family.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You were saved by Lady Sabina, who brought you into her home, with the condition that you join an organization that keeps the Seiyslan people safe. You'll have the chance to meet 5 love interests along the way:\u00a0<strong>Seiji</strong>\u2014your protective\u00a0best friend, <strong>Myo</strong>\u2014the charming rebel leader,\u00a0<strong>Taji</strong>\u2014your mysterious rival, <strong>Laisa</strong>\u2014a cunning pirate, and <strong>Lien</strong>\u2014the conqueror who separated you from your family.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>10 years later, when the curses that come only once a century resurface,\u00a0you are tasked to protect the Seiyslan Empire, the very people that took everything away from you, and are\u00a0faced with a choice that forces you to decide on the path you\u2019re willing to take to come to terms with your past. <strong>Who are you willing to sacrifice?</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348900/extras/364b5bad6daa00b27fc97e218700744c.avif?t=1769529640\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348900/extras_big/364b5bad6daa00b27fc97e218700744c.avif?t=1769529640 width=800 height=72 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>5 Romanceable Routes: Who Will You Sacrifice?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of The Lilies features 5 love interests, each with their own views and personal stories. Get to know the characters and form bonds that may last or falter in the face of conflict.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.ste